        "meta_description": "A project aimed at creating a ranking of Kenyan music based on popularity by leveraging data from streaming platforms.",
        "meta_image": "/media/chartske/kecharts-hero.webp",
        "meta_title": "Chartske",
        "title": "Chartske",
        "intro": "A Billboard Hot 100-style ranking platform, but for Kenyan music, built to give local artists visibility and expose listeners to Kenyan music they might not otherwise discover. Charts are split by genre.",
        "slug": "chartske",
        "content": [
          {
            "_type": "project_process_work",
            "items": [
              {
                "copy": "Integrated the YouTube Music and Spotify APIs to pull streaming data, then designed a homogenized scoring system to make numbers from the two platforms comparable and rank tracks on a single combined chart.",
                "link_file": null,
                "link_internal_type": null,
                "link_internal": null,
                "image": "/media/chartske/chartske-main-2-desktop.webp",
                "image_dimensions": {
                  "_type": "sanity.imageDimensions",
                  "width": 1600,
                  "aspectRatio": 1.7777777777777777,
                  "height": 900
                },
                "image_alt": null,
                "heading": null,
                "image_is_decorative": true,
                "include_cta": "none",
                "cta_text": null,
                "link_external": null
              },
              {
                "copy": "Built a custom scraper to pull Spotify stream counts, since that data isn't exposed through Spotify's public API",
                "link_file": null,
                "link_internal_type": null,
                "link_internal": null,
                "image": "/media/chartske/chartske-logo.webp",
                "image_dimensions": {
                  "_type": "sanity.imageDimensions",
                  "width": 1600,
                  "aspectRatio": 1.7777777777777777,
                  "height": 900
                },
                "image_alt": null,
                "heading": null,
                "image_is_decorative": true,
                "include_cta": "none",
                "cta_text": null,
                "link_external": null
              },
              {
                "copy": "Sourced and curated the underlying catalog of Kenyan music by researching playlists and artists across both platforms, then built a database of artists and tracks to power the platform.",
                "link_file": null,
                "link_internal_type": null,
                "link_internal": null,
                "image": "/media/chartske/chartske-explore-desktop.webp",
                "image_dimensions": {
                  "_type": "sanity.imageDimensions",
                  "width": 1600,
                  "aspectRatio": 1.7777777777777777,
                  "height": 900
                },
                "image_alt": null,
                "heading": null,
                "image_is_decorative": true,
                "include_cta": "none",
                "cta_text": null,
                "link_external": null
              },
              {
                "copy": "Built a search feature covering artists, tracks, and albums across both platforms — surfacing details like follower counts, full discographies, and top tracks for artists, and streaming numbers for individual songs/albums.",
                "link_file": null,
                "link_internal_type": null,
                "link_internal": null,
                "image": "/media/chartske/chartske-search-yt-desktop.webp",
                "image_dimensions": {
                  "_type": "sanity.imageDimensions",
                  "width": 1600,
                  "aspectRatio": 1.7777777777777777,
                  "height": 900
                },
                "image_alt": null,
                "heading": null,
                "image_is_decorative": true,
                "include_cta": "none",
                "cta_text": null,
                "link_external": null
              },
              {
                "copy": "Designed the brand identity, including the logo and overall visual design language, to create a cohesive and visually appealing platform that reflects the Kenyan music scene.",
                "link_file": null,
                "link_internal_type": null,
                "link_internal": null,
                "image": "/media/chartske/chartske-home-desktop.webp",
                "image_dimensions": {
